<title>NETHERLANDS: WEGENER BUYS FRENCH RECORD LABEL.</title>
<headline>WEGENER BUYS FRENCH RECORD LABEL.</headline>
<dateline>APELDOORN, Netherlands 1996-12-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dutch newspaper group and music publisher Wegener NV said on Friday its musical division Arcade had agreed to take over French record label Flarenasch.</p>
</text>
